<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley sets Bk of E.Asia warrant.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets Bk of E.Asia warrant.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it launched 88 million warrants on Bank of East Asia Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$35.80	   PREMIUM	    16.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.5907	  GEARING	    6.1X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  02.FEB.98	  SETTLEMENT DATE  03.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	  LISTING DATE     07.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$35.80	   MIN EXER LOT     2,000</p>
<p>NOTE CASH OR PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT AT THE ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
